      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We call it the Crypt of Murmurs — 'tis the\r\nwaterways running through its depths, mayhap,\r\nthat lend it a solemn air.",
        "Jp" : "俺たちは《せせらぎの地下聖堂》と\r\n呼んでいるが――\r\n内部に引かれた水路のせいか\r\n一種おごそかな雰囲気が漂っている"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482950,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
